Package: cm5-mmc-fix
Version: 1.2.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Provides: cm5-sd-delay-fix, cm5-sd-fix
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Raspberry Pi CM5 / CM5 Lite Empty MicroSD Slot Shutdown Delay Fix
 Fixes the 30-80s shutdown/reboot hang on Raspberry Pi CM5 Lite when the
 microSD slot is empty.
 Patches the BCM2712 SDHCI 100kHz hardware timeout bug in mmc_rescan freqs[],
 installs cm5-sdcard-fast device-tree overlay to bypass SDIO/eMMC probes, and
 registers an automatic kernel postinst hook to persist across all apt upgrades.
 Keeps microSD hotplugging and booting 100% intact.
